Based on my analysis of the glass-badge component from https://github.com/einui/einui, here are **all CSS rules and exact style values** for the component:

## RAW CSS PROPERTIES (Converted from Tailwind)

### Base Container Styles
```css
display: inline-flex;
align-items: center;
border-radius: 9999px;
padding-left: 0.75rem;
padding-right: 0.75rem;
padding-top: 0.25rem;
padding-bottom: 0.25rem;
font-size: 0.75rem;
font-weight: 500;
backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
border: 1px solid;
transition: all 300ms cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
```

